The native graph adaptation, reference implementation and FP32 coefficients derive
from libfacedetection, upstream commit acf7b254121927e7dced30e233a2e03119f28ea2.
Copyright and BSD 3-clause terms are retained in vendor/libfacedetection/LICENSE
and in the original upstream files. Preserve those notices with redistributions.

The emulator repository's original licensing files and individual-file notices
remain applicable. No Fujifilm firmware or decoded vendor binary is included.

The astronaut image is the NASA Eileen Collins sample retained by the native
experiment. Derived fixture generation and source identity are recorded in
tests/fixtures/manifest.json. Its limited face set is a correctness fixture,
not a general accuracy benchmark.
